#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9634
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"After treating Ensign Fargalli, we took a closer look at the accompanying "
"research. Analysis of the research material, the telemetry from your ship, "
"and recent reports from intelligence brings us to an ominous conclusion."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9640
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What have you concluded?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9644
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Fargalli's illness and the previous similar cases experienced were not "
"accidental. They were deliberately infected."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9648
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What? Who infected them?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9653
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"The Exuari. Fargalli and others are apparently the victims of a preliminary "
"experimental biological attack. The Exuari have code named this biological "
"agent Omicron after the early 21st century pandemic virus variant on Earth "
"which was highly contagious."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9659
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "That's sobering. Do we have more information?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9665
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Indeed we do. It looks like Omicron might be transmitted via subspace. We "
"believe the Exuari plan to 'broadcast' Omicron to every known human "
"location. Needless to say, this would have extinction level consequences."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9671
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "Ouch. Is there a planned response?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9677
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Destruction of the Exuari Omicron production and broadcast facility is the "
"best thing we can think of."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9681
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "Can we help?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9686
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"We hope that you can. We don't know the precise location of the Exuari "
"facility, just a general direction. However, when we examined the telemetry "
"from your science officer's console when you were near the independent "
"medical research facility, we noticed something interesting."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9692
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What did you notice?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9698
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"The entity used to produce the treatment is also likely to be used to create "
"Omicron. It gives off a powerful bio-signature that is periodic in nature, "
"vaguely resembling a heartbeat."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9704
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "This signature can identify the Exuari Omicron facility?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9711
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Yes, but if you're unsure, you are authorized to destroy every Exuari "
"facility. You will need to travel into Exuari infested space along bearing "
"%i from station %s to find the Omicron facility and destroy it. Our best "
"intelligence estimates that deployment will occur within the next %i "
"minutes. Happy hunting!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9739
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"To %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Ensign Fargalli, one of the maintenance engineers aboard the freighter %s, "
"just reported to sickbay here on %s. We can treat his symptoms, but don't "
"have a treatment for the root cause of his illness. This is the third case "
"of this type we've seen in the last week. The last two ended up being fatal."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9748
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Why are you telling me this?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9754
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We've received word that Independent station %s is conducting ongoing "
"research into this malady and may have more information, maybe even a remedy."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9763
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Then you should get that treatment from %s to save Fargalli"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9772
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We can't contact %s directly since they are not on our communications "
"network."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9778
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "A courier could get it"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9784
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We tried sending couriers. All of our couriers were shot down. We are "
"telling you all this because we need you to go to %s and bring back any "
"medical research or treatment or medicine they may have"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9790
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Now I understand"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9796
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"There is some urgency. Based on the previous cases, Fargalli has about %i "
"minutes to live"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9805
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Where is station %s?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9815
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "%s is in sector %s. Good luck"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9826
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"%s is on an approximate bearing of %i from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9851
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"%s is on a precise bearing of %.1f from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9875
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Hello, %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9883
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Hello, %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9890
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"One of the commercial freighters just docked up and their personnel inferred "
"that you might be traveling in our direction."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9894
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Those are well informed personnel"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9899
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"It's amazing what commercial freighters learn and how quickly they learn it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9905
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Indeed. Why are you contacting us?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9911
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We were wondering how soon you might get here. You see, there's this group "
"of Exuari approaching and they don't look terribly friendly."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9917
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We intend to get medical research, not necessarily engage Exuari"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9923
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We could make it worth your while if you were to protect our station from "
"these Exuari."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9927
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9932
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"If you were to destroy the attacking Exuari, we could offer you one of these:"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9938
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "25% faster impulse speed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9947
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9969
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9993
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:10018
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "You got it. We're in sector %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9958
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Rapid transit back to %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:9984
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "25% stronger beam weapons"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:10009
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Replenish all your ordnance"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:10031
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We just need to know where you are located"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:10045
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We added paypoint %i to your system which identifies our station. We may or "
"may not be able to provide what you request depending on how busy we are "
"fighting off Exuari."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:10055
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We are in sector %s. We may or may not be able to provide what you request "
"depending on how busy we are fighting off Exuari."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:10068
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Sounds bad. Do you need help?"
